# 中文：真实值由 generate-runtime-env.py 写入 runtime/.env.runtime（0600），不要手填后提交。
# English: generate-runtime-env.py writes real values to runtime/.env.runtime (0600); never commit it.
# Required names: FITCREW_PUBLIC_HOST, POSTGRES_PASSWORD, BODYOS_ENCRYPTION_KEY,
# BODYOS_OWNER_TOKEN, BODYOS_IDENTITY_PEPPER, BODYOS_INTERNAL_TOKEN,
# BODYOS_MODEL_PROXY_TOKEN, FEISHU_APP_ID, FEISHU_APP_SECRET,
# FEISHU_ALLOWED_USERS, FEISHU_ALLOWED_GROUP_ID, FEISHU_HOME_CHANNEL.
